---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import MiniGrid from '../components/MiniGrid.astro';
import PuzzleCard from '../components/PuzzleCard.astro';
import puzzles from '../data/puzzles.json';
---
<Layout><section class="hero container"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="little-spark">✻</span> A LITTLE JOY, ONE WORD AT A TIME</p><h1>Big letters.<br/>Little victories.<br/><em>Your daily crossword.</em></h1><p class="hero-description">Free large print crossword puzzles, made easy to enjoy. Play online or print a page, pour a cup, and take your time.</p><div class="hero-buttons"><a class="button" href="/daily/">Play today’s puzzle <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="button button-outline" href="/printable/"><span aria-hidden="true">▤</span> Find a printable</a></div><p class="hero-reassurance"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span> No account. No timer. Just a good puzzle.</p></div><div class="hero-art"><div class="paper-note"><span aria-hidden="true">✦</span> A fresh little challenge</div><div class="hero-paper"><div class="paper-top"><span>THE DAILY CROSSWORD</span><span>No. 001</span></div><h2>A little time<br/>in the garden.</h2><MiniGrid puzzle={puzzles[0]} filled/><div class="paper-bottom"><span>EASY & ENJOYABLE</span><span aria-hidden="true">✻</span></div></div><div class="pencil" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="floating-note"><span aria-hidden="true">Aa</span><div>Easy on the eyes.<br/><strong>Good for the soul.</strong></div></div></div></section>
<section class="benefit-strip" aria-label="Made for a comfortable experience"><div class="container benefit-grid"><div><span class="benefit-icon">Aa</span><p><strong>Comfortably large</strong><span>Clear letters & easy-to-read clues</span></p></div><div><span class="benefit-icon" aria-hidden="true">▤</span><p><strong>Paper or screen</strong><span>Play your way, wherever you are</span></p></div><div><span class="benefit-icon" aria-hidden="true">◷</span><p><strong>At your own pace</strong><span>No clock. No rush. No pressure.</span></p></div></div></section>
<section class="section container"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT LITTLE BREAK</p><h2>Find a puzzle you’ll love.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/crosswords/">Explore all puzzles <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div class="puzzle-cards">{puzzles.slice(0,3).map((p,i)=><PuzzleCard puzzle={p} index={i}/>)}</div></section>
<section class="print-feature container"><div class="print-illustration" aria-hidden="true"><div class="print-sheet"><span>LARGE PRINT CROSSWORDS</span><h3>Just add a pencil.</h3><MiniGrid puzzle={puzzles[2]}/><div class="fake-lines"></div></div><span class="print-stamp">PRINT<br/>& ENJOY</span></div><div class="print-copy"><p class="eyebrow">FOR THE PAPER-AND-PENCIL PEOPLE</p><h2>Your favorite chair.<br/>A fresh printed puzzle.</h2><p>Sometimes, simple is best. Our free printables have generous letters, clear clues, and a separate answer page. Just choose a puzzle and make yourself comfortable.</p><a class="button" href="/printable/">Browse printable puzzles <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><p class="small-note">US Letter size · Answer sheets included · No sign-up</p></div></section>
<section class="section container how-section"><p class="eyebrow">A PLEASANT LITTLE ROUTINE</p><h2>Make a little room for play.</h2><div class="steps"><div><span>01</span><h3>Pick your puzzle</h3><p>Find a familiar theme, from the garden to the kitchen table.</p></div><div><span>02</span><h3>Settle in</h3><p>Play right here or print a copy. A cup of something nice is optional.</p></div><div><span>03</span><h3>Enjoy every word</h3><p>Take your time. Use a hint if you like. Every little victory counts.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="welcome-banner container"><span class="welcome-flower" aria-hidden="true">✻</span><div><h2>A warm welcome, every day.</h2><p>Easy crosswords for older adults, curious minds, and anyone who likes their letters a little larger.</p></div><a class="button button-light" href="/daily/">Let’s start a puzzle →</a></section>
<section class="section container faq-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">A FEW HELPFUL ANSWERS</p><h2>Good to know.</h2></div><div class="faq-list"><details><summary>Are the crossword puzzles free?</summary><p>Yes. Every puzzle in our current collection is free to play and print. You do not need an account or an email address.</p></details><details><summary>Can I print the puzzles with answers?</summary><p>Yes. Each puzzle has a dedicated print page. Print the puzzle first, then use the separate answer-sheet button when you need it. Your browser can also save either sheet as a PDF.</p></details><details><summary>Will my online progress be saved?</summary><p>Your answers are saved in this browser on this device when local storage is available. You can leave and return to the same puzzle. Clearing browser data removes your progress.</p></details><details><summary>Are these crosswords suitable for beginners?</summary><p>Our themed mini crosswords use everyday American English and direct clues. There is no timer, and you can reveal a letter whenever you need a hand.</p></details></div></section></Layout>
